[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1743.672, "timestamp": "00:29:03", "text": "藥品。我的天哪，這是藥。 我的天哪，這，呃，這…"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1749.408, "timestamp": "00:29:09", "text": "我的天哪，這，呃，這… 味道和英國的一樣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1750.981, "timestamp": "00:29:10", "text": "味道和英國的一樣 藥品。我，我告訴你，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1756.545, "timestamp": "00:29:16", "text": "藥品。我，我告訴你， 就像，你知道，那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1757.727, "timestamp": "00:29:17", "text": "就像，你知道，那些 你把它當感冒藥吃。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1759.083, "timestamp": "00:29:19", "text": "你把它當感冒藥吃。 或類似的東西，就是那個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1760.438, "timestamp": "00:29:20", "text": "或類似的東西，就是那個 紅色液體"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1761.481, "timestamp": "00:29:21", "text": "紅色液體 一種藥物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1762.594, "timestamp": "00:29:22", "text": "一種藥物 如此奇怪的味道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1763.845, "timestamp": "00:29:23", "text": "如此奇怪的味道 餘韻。是的，正是如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1768.45, "timestamp": "00:29:28", "text": "餘韻。是的，正是如此。 那。相同的。顯然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1777.99, "timestamp": "00:29:37", "text": "那。相同的。顯然 住在這裡真好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1778.988, "timestamp": "00:29:38", "text": "住在這裡真好 寒冷的國家。雖然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1781.285, "timestamp": "00:29:41", "text": "寒冷的國家。雖然 這並不容易。我從未"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1783.963, "timestamp": "00:29:43", "text": "這並不容易。我從未 我沒看到下雪，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1785.283, "timestamp": "00:29:45", "text": "我沒看到下雪， 沒碰雪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1790.021, "timestamp": "00:29:50", "text": "所以我正在等待…"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1791.0, "timestamp": "00:29:51", "text": "十二月，但在這裡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1792.109, "timestamp": "00:29:52", "text": "氣溫將會下降"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1795.327, "timestamp": "00:29:55", "text": "零下。因此，對我而言，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1796.549, "timestamp": "00:29:56", "text": "我好害怕，這是怎麼回事？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1799.64, "timestamp": "00:29:59", "t